WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.362
Where are agencies?

2
00:00:01.362 --> 00:00:04.613
The workbook's baseline is G C C Moderate.

3
00:00:04.613 --> 00:00:08.000
Microsoft 365 G C C pairs
with commercial Azure,

4
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.387
so a G C C agency's
subscriptions are commercial,

5
00:00:11.387 --> 00:00:16.512
and the guide's commands run as written,
with the cloud set to Azure Cloud.

6
00:00:16.512 --> 00:00:19.942
The guide's table, Availability
in commercial Azure,

7
00:00:19.942 --> 00:00:22.574
says what to plan for, service by service.

8
00:00:22.574 --> 00:00:27.632
Front Door Standard and Premium are
available, and Front Door classic

9
00:00:27.632 --> 00:00:32.950
retires on March thirty-first, 2027,
and accepts no new profiles or domains.

10
00:00:32.950 --> 00:00:38.607
DDoS Network Protection is billed per
plan, and I P Protection per protected I P.

11
00:00:38.607 --> 00:00:42.262
Private Link uses one central
D N S zone per service.

12
00:00:42.262 --> 00:00:45.663
The FedRAMP initiatives are
built into Azure Policy.

13
00:00:45.663 --> 00:00:48.188
And the landing zone
accelerators are supported.

14
00:00:48.188 --> 00:00:51.460
Later modules name what to
plan for in their own steps.
